1
00:00:00,085 --> 00:00:04,505
Doug? Oh, yeah. I don't know. I mean,
you know, he's nice and funny, but...

2
00:00:04,672 --> 00:00:06,922
- Can I get you started with some drinks?
- No. Bzzz.

3
00:00:08,176 --> 00:00:10,346
- You were saying, "But..."?
- I'd like a drink.

4
00:00:10,512 --> 00:00:13,762
Just say the "but" thing about Doug,
and then I'll get her back.

5
00:00:14,349 --> 00:00:17,189
Okay, well, it...
I don't know. It's just me.

6
00:00:17,352 --> 00:00:19,522
(Penny:)I'm still getting over this break-up
with Kurt.

7
00:00:19,687 --> 00:00:22,527
(Penny:)And this thing with Doug
would just be rebound sex.

8
00:00:23,066 --> 00:00:27,276
(Leonard:)Ugh. Don't get me started
on rebound sex.

9
00:00:27,654 --> 00:00:29,114
(Penny:)It's just... It's my pattern.

10
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:31,490
(Penny:)I break up, then I find some cute guy...

11
00:00:31,658 --> 00:00:35,368
(Penny:)...and then it's just
36 meaningless hours of...

12
00:00:35,537 --> 00:00:36,787
(Penny:)Well, you know.

13
00:00:38,832 --> 00:00:40,252
(Leonard:)I'm not sure that I do. Um...

14
00:00:41,584 --> 00:00:46,424
Is that one 36-hour experience
or is that 36 hours spread out over...

15
00:00:46,589 --> 00:00:50,049
...say, one glorious summer?

16
00:00:50,218 --> 00:00:51,718
(Penny:)No. It's usually over a weekend.

17
00:00:51,886 --> 00:00:54,636
(Penny:)And trust me,
you do not feel good after it.

18
00:00:55,014 --> 00:00:58,024
(Leonard:)Well, chafing, right?

